{"ref":"BDB, בָּכוּת","hw":"בָּכוּת","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בָּכוּת</span></big>  <strong>n.f. weeping</strong>. Only in <span dir=\"rtl\">אַלּוֹן בָּכוּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 35:8\" href=\"/Genesis.35.8\">Gn 35:8</a> i.e. <em>mourning oak</em>, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אַלּוֹן\" href=\"/BDB,_אַלּוֹן\", dir=\"rtl\">אלון</a>, p. 47.","next":"BDB, בְּכִית","prev":"BDB, בְּכִי"}